{
 "brief": "Legal scholar Dr. Raki Al-Mesmaari told Shehab Wire that the occupation is capitalizing on global disarray to target Palestinians of all faiths. He cited a strike on a residential building west of Gaza City that killed five people, including four women—two of them Christian—as evidence of ongoing violations demanding Arab League action led by Egypt and the Organization of Islamic Cooperation.\n\nAl-Mesmaari said the continued breaches require coordinated regional response from the Arab bloc and Islamic bodies to address the targeting of both Muslim and Christian Palestinians.",
